    {
      "name": "Poison Stock",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>When the cabinet hits a creature with its poison bottle Strike, roll 1d4 to determine what kind of poison splashes onto the struck creature:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>nerve poison (Clumsy 1)</li>\n<li>weakening poison (Enfeebled 1)</li>\n<li>noxious poison (Sickened 1)</li>\n<li>clouded mind poison (Stupefied 1).</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The target must attempt a DC 24 Fortitude Saving Throw save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unafected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes 1d6 Poison Damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes 2d6 Poison Damage and is aficted with the rolled poison's associated condition until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes 2d6 Poison Damage and is aficted with the rolled poison's associated condition for 1d4+1 #rounds rounds.</p>",
